1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
My name is Mirsina Aghdam, CEO of EDGE — Earthwise Dynamics Geo Environs.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Europe needs more secure and responsible access to critical minerals.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Yet identifying and prioritising promising areas for exploration remains slow, fragmented and expensive.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:37,000
At EDGE, we are developing TerraLens AI: an evidence-led system that brings together drone gamma-ray spectrometry, LiDAR, satellite and hyperspectral data, geochemistry, mineralogy and geological records.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:47,000
The aim is practical. TerraLens AI helps exploration teams identify, assess and prioritise potential rare-earth targets with a clearer, traceable evidence trail.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:59,000
With support from ESA BIC Ireland, we are progressing terrestrial development and preparing field validation across European geological settings, beginning with collaboration opportunities in Sweden.

7
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:07,000
This terrestrial work will provide the foundation for AstraLens: EDGE’s future roadmap for space-enabled mineral intelligence.

8
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:15,000
EDGE combines geoengineering, AI automation and Earth observation to support more informed decisions in the critical-minerals sector.
